  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "big-twist-winter-bulky-stripes",
      "name": "Big Twist® Winter Bulky Stripes Yarn",
      "masterSku": "M300005466",
      "productUrl": "https://www.michaels.com/product/10826104",
      "care": "Machine wash cold, gentle cycle. Non-chlorine bleach only. Dry flat. Do not iron.",
      "description": "<p>Big Twist Winter Bulky is a festive, striped skein perfect for when your handmade creations call for a bit of holiday cheer. This premium acrylic yarn will work well for making cozy Christmas throw blankets, warm hats and scarves for snowy days, huggable stuffed animals to place under the tree and more! With a variety of color mixes to select from, this yarn is an excellent choice for most any project that inspires you!</p><p><br></p><p>We understand the importance of dye lots and will try to match dye lots for your order, however, we cannot guarantee all skeins will be the same dye lot.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Weight:</strong> Bulky (5)</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Contents:</strong> 100% premium acrylic</p><p><strong>Skein Weight:</strong> 7 oz. / 200 g</p><p><strong>Yardage:</strong> 131.2 yd. / 120 m</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Knitting Gauge:</strong></p><p>10 sts - 15 rows = 4\" (10 cm)</p><p><strong>Crochet Gauge:</strong></p><p>8 sc - 5 rows = 4\" (10 cm)</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Suggested Knitting Needle:</strong></p><p>9 to 10 mm, US - 13 to 15</p><p><strong>Suggested Crochet Hook:</strong></p><p>8 mm, US - L/11</p><p><br></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "caron-birthday-cupcakes",
      "name": "Caron® Birthday Cupcakes™ Yarn",
      "masterSku": "M300005478",
      "productUrl": "https://www.michaels.com/product/10819953",
      "care": "Machine wash (not exceeding 104°F/40°C), delicate setting. Do not bleach. Tumble dry, low heat, delicate setting. Do not iron or press. Do not dry clean.",
      "description": "<p>Caron Birthday Cupcakes are a super-sweet mini version of Caron Cakes, including a faux fur pom pom on top! One cupcake makes a colorful hat, and accessorizing is easy with the matching pom pom. This 100% acrylic yarn is easy care and easy to love.</p><p><br></p><p>We understand the importance of dye lots and will try to match dye lots for your order, however, we cannot guarantee all skeins will be the same dye lot.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Weight:</strong> Bulky (5)</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Contents:</strong> 100% acrylic yarn with 50% polyester, 50% olefin pom pom</p><p><strong>Skein Weight:</strong> 3.5 oz. / 100 g</p><p><strong>Yardage:&nbsp;</strong>138 yd. / 126 m</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Knitting Gauge:</strong></p><p>13 sts - 18 rows = 4\" (10 cm)</p><p><strong>Crochet Gauge:</strong></p><p>9 sc - 10 rows = 4\" (10 cm)</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Suggested Knitting Needle:</strong></p><p>6.5 mm, US - 10.5</p><p><strong>Suggested Crochet Hook:</strong></p><p>6.5 mm, US - K/10.5</p><p><br></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "charisma-tweed-stripe",
      "name": "Charisma® Tweed Stripe Yarn by Loops & Threads®",
      "masterSku": "M10519020",
      "productUrl": "https://www.michaels.com/product/10519017",
      "care": "Machine wash warm, gentle cycle. Do not bleach. Tumble dry low. Do not iron.",
      "description": "Indulge your creativity with this tweed-style skein. Make a knit coat or cardigan inspired by the classic tweed blazer or a comfy blanket, scarf or hat! The Charisma Tweed Stripe is a wonderfully soft, bulky weight yarn that works up into classically colored stripes with a touch of tweed.<br><br>We understand the importance of dye lots and will try to match dye lots for your order, however, we cannot guarantee all skeins will be the same dye lot.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Weight:</b> Bulky (5)<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Contents:</b> 97% acrylic, 3% viscose<br>\r\n<b>Skein Weight:</b> 3.5 oz. / 100 g<br>\r\n<b>Yardage:</b> 109 yd. / 100 m<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Knitting Gauge:<br>\r\n</b>11 sts - 16 rows = 4\" (10 cm)<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Suggested Knitting Needle:<br>\r\n</b>9 mm, US - 13<br>\r\n<b>Suggested Crochet Hook:<br>\r\n</b>8 mm, US - L/11"
    },
    {
      "id": "charisma-heather",
      "name": "Charisma™ Heather Yarn by Loops & Threads®",
      "masterSku": "M10412533",
      "productUrl": "https://www.michaels.com/product/10632213",
      "care": "Machine wash warm, tumble dry low. Non-chlorine bleach when needed. Do not iron.",
      "description": "Indulge your creativity with these delicious textures and colors of yarn! Ideal for afghans, scarves, cowls and hats, Charisma Heather is a wonderfully soft, bulky weight yarn in a variety of soft heather shades. This 100% acrylic yarn is easy to use and works up quickly.<br><br>We understand the importance of dye lots and will try to match dye lots for your order, however, we cannot guarantee all skeins will be the same dye lot.<br>\r\n<br><b>\r\nWeight:</b> Bulky (5)\r\n<br>\r\n<br><b>\r\nContents:</b> 100% acrylic\r\n<br><b>\r\nSkein Weight:</b> 3 oz. / 85 g\r\n<br><b>\r\nYardage:</b> 93 yd. / 85 m\r\n<br>\r\n<br><b>\r\nKnitting Gauge:\r\n</b><br>\r\n11 sts - 16 rows = 4\" (10 cm)\r\n<br>\r\n<br><b>\r\nSuggested Knitting Needle:\r\n</b><br>\r\n9 mm, US - 13\r\n<br><b>\r\nSuggested Crochet Hook:\r\n</b><br>\r\n8 mm, US - L/11&nbsp;\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThis yarn has Class 1 Oeko-Tex® certification. This means that all the materials and dyes have been tested rigorously in the most stringent conditions ensuring they don't contain any irritants or allergens that might irritate the most sensitive skin."
    }
  ],
